Docket No. EL26-71-000 

MOTION TO RESCIND SHOW CAUSE ORDER AND 
CONDITIONAL REQUEST FOR EXTENSION OF TIME 
ON BEHALF OF VALLEY ELECTRIC ASSOCIATION, INC. 

Pursuant to Rule 212 of the Commission’s Rules of Practice and Procedure,1 Valley 
Electric Association, Inc. (“VEA”) moves the Commission to rescind the show cause order issued 
in this proceeding on June 18, 2026,2 as directed to VEA as a Participating Transmission Owner 
(“TO”) in the California Independent System Operator Corporation (“CAISO”). VEA is an electric 
cooperative that is not a public utility under Section 201(f) of the Federal Power Act (“FPA”). The 
Commission has stated that it will rescind the Show Cause Order as to any non-public utility at its 

